ekc:Story <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "Description of historical knowledge that explains the background of discovering data nodes"@en,
                                                        "데이터 노드 발굴의 배경이 된 역사적 지식에 대한 서술"@ko;
          a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
          rdfs:label "Story"@en.
ekc:TM a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
       rdfs:label "TM"@en;
       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "연표의 구성을 지시하는 관계"@ko.
ekc:Text <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "Text in the literature that functions as evidence of explanation"@en,
