                a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                rdfs:label "WebResource"@en.
ekc:Work <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "Works of art such as literature, fine arts, music, dance, performance, etc."@en,
                                                       "문학, 미술, 음악, 연희, 무용 등의 문예 작품"@ko;
         a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
         rdfs:label "Work"@en.
ekc:XR a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
       rdfs:label "XR"@en;
       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "참고자료를 지시하는 관계"@ko.
