            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "현대미술가협회 - 하인두"@ko;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "기관/단체/장소 설립자. 권위로써 무엇을 만들도록 함."@ko;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Domain : Architecture/Agent(Actor의 subclasses 중 기관, 단체 등)".
ekc:goesWith <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "~를 수반하다"@ko;
             a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
             rdfs:domain ekc:Object;
             rdfs:label "goesWith"@en;
             rdfs:range ekc:Object;
             rdfs:subPropertyOf ekc:OB;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "외궤 - 내함"@ko;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> """의식에서 물품 간의 수반 관계
A는 B와 함께 착용하였다/사용되었다
A는 B에 올려졌다
A는 B를 담는다/감싼다
A는 B로 운반되었다""".
ekc:hasAdoptedHeir <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "양자 ~를 두었다"@ko;
                   a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                   rdfs:domain ekc:Actor;
                   rdfs:label "hasAdoptedHeir"@en;
                   rdfs:range ekc:Actor;
                   rdfs:subPropertyOf ekc:A1;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> ekc:isAdoptedHeirOf;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "윤이석 - 윤두서"@ko;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "양자(가계상속 목적)"@ko.
ekc:hasAffiliation <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "~에 소속하다"@ko;
